{"3321680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Zombie Survival Guide", "steam_appid": 3321680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The end is approaching, and there is an outbreak of biochemical viruses ...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your daughter suffers from chronic asthma, and as a father, your top priority is to go to the hospital, even though it is now full of danger ...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/975fd60ac9c5830ff3387355048109f9.avif?t=1761541083\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Reasonably plan resources: food, beverages, water, and cooking ingredients Ensure that you and your daughter are in good physical condition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/2d2cd565788292783994d39f7591b201.avif?t=1761541083\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade your hiding place to create a shelter for your daughter and survivors.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search buildings, discover survivors, accept as teammates, attitude towards teammates will affect the subsequent game progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/a4fe642df9f273a113544b7a9e1594aa.avif?t=1761541083\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Having a variety of weapons to choose from: melee weapons, pistols, shotguns, assault rifles ... and can be customized and upgraded at the engineer's office.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting alongside survivors can also allow them to protect their daughters at home and earn you more exploration time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/85cfdd74ec66ded6a765d094e26b12a2.avif?t=1761541083\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the zombie survival guide that outlines everything you need to do in the coming days, including sleazy development, safety first, and protecting your daughter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/f41584bf0cf7a945a2b7e389417d3515.avif?t=1761541083\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Faced with an endless stream of corpses, the level design will provide heavy firepower to help resist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/933a50c44611fcdc4f82130112a98a00.avif?t=1761541083\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras_big/933a50c44611fcdc4f82130112a98a00.avif?t=1761541083 width=800 height=554 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/ff1e7bff8fb333f745ed831600a9f994.avif?t=1761541083\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras_big/ff1e7bff8fb333f745ed831600a9f994.avif?t=1761541083 width=800 height=627 /></span>*Search every building recklessly! Be careful, the interior of the building is full of unknowns, NPCs in need of help, malicious enemies, etc .....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*A large amount of text plot filling, mainly linear plot, and providing branching options, each of your choices will affect the fate of an NPC or the player themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The end is approaching, and there is an outbreak of biochemical viruses ...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your daughter suffers from chronic asthma, and as a father, your top priority is to go to the hospital, even though it is now full of danger ...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/975fd60ac9c5830ff3387355048109f9.avif?t=1761541083\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Reasonably plan resources: food, beverages, water, and cooking ingredients Ensure that you and your daughter are in good physical condition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/2d2cd565788292783994d39f7591b201.avif?t=1761541083\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade your hiding place to create a shelter for your daughter and survivors.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search buildings, discover survivors, accept as teammates, attitude towards teammates will affect the subsequent game progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/a4fe642df9f273a113544b7a9e1594aa.avif?t=1761541083\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Having a variety of weapons to choose from: melee weapons, pistols, shotguns, assault rifles ... and can be customized and upgraded at the engineer's office.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting alongside survivors can also allow them to protect their daughters at home and earn you more exploration time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/85cfdd74ec66ded6a765d094e26b12a2.avif?t=1761541083\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the zombie survival guide that outlines everything you need to do in the coming days, including sleazy development, safety first, and protecting your daughter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/f41584bf0cf7a945a2b7e389417d3515.avif?t=1761541083\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Faced with an endless stream of corpses, the level design will provide heavy firepower to help resist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/933a50c44611fcdc4f82130112a98a00.avif?t=1761541083\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras_big/933a50c44611fcdc4f82130112a98a00.avif?t=1761541083 width=800 height=554 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras/ff1e7bff8fb333f745ed831600a9f994.avif?t=1761541083\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321680/extras_big/ff1e7bff8fb333f745ed831600a9f994.avif?t=1761541083 width=800 height=627 /></span>*Search every building recklessly! Be careful, the interior of the building is full of unknowns, NPCs in need of help, malicious enemies, etc .....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*A large amount of text plot filling, mainly linear plot, and providing branching options, each of your choices will affect the fate of an NPC or the player themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "is a 3D side scrolling real-time combat game Under the outbreak o